WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.730
Your tasks. Your notes. Your files.

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:04.710
And that promise from Monday?

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:05.676
Gone.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:10.750
Meet MemoValet. Your personal assistant for work and for life.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.398
Your whole day on one screen.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:14.750
Just ask.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.777
What did I promise to do this week?

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:20.300
Send a job to anyone with a link.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:22.070
Done. And you're told.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.359
Meet in 21 languages.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.135
Everything on your plate taken care of.
